# Handcode Lab

This repository is a personal hand-coding curriculum for AI/ML/Python/Rust.

## Rules

- Follow root `AGENTS.md`.
- Do not write the core algorithm/control loop for the active `projects/pXX-*` track from scratch.
- Allowed: theory, quizzes, interface sketches, reviews, debug help after an attempt, tests.
- Disallowed by default: full solutions, swapping in LangChain/LlamaIndex/etc. to skip learning, dumping large unrelated files.
- Confirm which project (`p01`–`p24`) is active before substantial edits.
- Prefer small diffs inside the active project directory.
